OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FIt will be cloudy with light
OL,6,Frain and drizzle in the morning,
OL,7,Fperhaps drier for a while around
OL,8,Flunchtime. The rain will become
OL,9,Fpersistent and heavy at times during
OL,10,Fthe afternoon.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FCloudy with outbreaks of
OL,13,Foccasionally heavy rain spreading east
OL,14,Fthrough the evening. Staying cloudy
OL,15,Fovernight with further outbreaks of
OL,16,Foccasionally heavy rain.
OL,17,
OL,18,CTuesday:FCloudy with occasionally
OL,19,Fheavy outbreaks of rain at first. Rain
OL,20,Fturning more showery later through the
OL,21,Fday but remaining heavy at times.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
