OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:
OL,6,FShowers clear on Wednesday, becoming
OL,7,Fdry and bright through the afternoon.
OL,8,FOutbreaks of rain, some heavy,
OL,9,FWednesday night turn showery Thursday.
OL,10,FShowers clear Friday morning, becoming
OL,11,Fdry and bright later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
